{"type":"HOSTEL","name":"Seaside Lodge","nameEN":"Seaside Lodge","isActive":true,"isNew":false,"description":"This hostel has been recently renovated with a beach-inspired aesthetic. The property is well-maintained, spacious, and features exceptional amenities, such as a pool table, ping pong table, large commercial kitchen, and a capacious outdoor area with a BBQ. Its location is highly convenient as it is just a short walk to Townsville's popular destinations, including the Strand, CBD, and reef HQ. A Coles supermarket is conveniently located next door, and numerous restaurants and cafes are within close proximity. Additionally, there is a waterfront pub only two minutes away that offers daily food specials.\r\n\r\n***Please note this property is self check in if after reception hours, you will be emailed check in details*** Reception is open from 9-5 Monday- Friday. We are available whenever needed. There is always staff on site. \r\n\r\nThere is a manager on site daily along with cleaners that clean the property every day. \r\n\r\nGuests will be charged anywhere up to 24 hours prior to check in\r\n\r\nAge requirement- All guests at Seaside Lodge must of at least 18 years of age,\r\n\r\nOur quiet hours are from 10pm- 6am.\r\n\r\nOnly paying guests allowed at the property.\r\n\r\nCancellations- for standard bookings you may cancel up to one day before your check in date.\r\n\r\nIf you no show for your booking, you will be charged for your stay.\r\n\r\nCheck in is from 3pm- guests are welcome to leave luggage or use facilities earlier than this, just depends on cleaners for check in. \r\nCheck out is 10am\r\n\r\nAn international passport or acceptable photo ID must be presented at check in for all guests.\r\n\r\nPlease note that all rooms have shared bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThere are 6 bathrooms in total, and the amenities are cleaned daily.","hostelworldSays":null,"hostelSays":null,"businessNumber":"879 668 69886","location":{"address1":"19 Eyre st North Ward","address2